DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45624::$$$message_0433_0000_0000$$$::"Haah, haah... We made it... So this is the Holy Grail Onsen that grants wishes!"::
45625::$$$message_0433_0000_0001$$$::"We've done it, Kariya. Somehow, we escaped the extreme trouble we encountered along the way."::
45626::$$$message_0433_0000_0002$$$::"By the way, I've never bathed in an onsen.[wvl][hfpop layer=1] I'm aware of the custom, but the Lady of the Lake said that 'onsen are absurd' and forbade me from visiting them."::
45627::$$$message_0433_0000_0003$$$::"...Wait. Someone's coming."::
45628::$$$message_0433_0000_0004$$$::"Good morning. Are you ready to lose? Of course, I am."::
45629::$$$message_0433_0000_0005$$$::"Master, that way of speaking is problematic. It makes it sound as if you're the 'fool.'"::
45630::$$$message_0433_0000_0006$$$::"What's wrong with that, Kirei? I like the way Tokiomi's acting. His stiff formality shines all the better in this inopportune setting."::
45631::$$$message_0433_0000_0007$$$::"Call it the Tohsaka blood... They might actually have more of a talent for comic relief than magecraft, you know. They should keep cultivating that skill."::
45632::$$$message_0433_0000_0008$$$::"Your words honor me, King of Heroes. I shall endeavor to pass this talent down to my daughters.[wvl canskip=false time=50] Especially Rin."::
45633::$$$message_0433_0000_0009$$$::"Tokiomi...! I knew I'd face you last. Good. I'll kill two birds with one stone!"::
45634::$$$message_0433_0000_0010$$$::"I'll defeat you, rest in the onsen, visit a beauty salon,[wvl][hfwww layer=2] buy a suit at Blue Mountain, and go see Aoi!"::
45635::$$$message_0433_0000_0011$$$::"My plan is perfect! I bet even you could never have made such a perfect schedule when you were the class president in high school!"::
45636::$$$message_0433_0000_0012$$$::"...Heh. What a silly man. If it were me, I would have said that I'll buy some sweets to take back to Aoi."::
45637::$$$message_0433_0000_0013$$$::"As always, you are only thinking of yourself."::
45638::$$$message_0433_0000_0014$$$::"Gah! [wm canskip=0][wvl canskip=false time=100][hffgchg2 chara=雁夜 face=焦り2 pos=left time=300 twno=2][hfwww layer=0]Th-that's not true! I've been thinking about that, too! I just need the funds to..."::
45639::$$$message_0433_0000_0015$$$::"High income is a man's worth, as well as his duty. You should restart your education from there."::
45640::$$$message_0433_0000_0016$$$::"Guagh![wm canskip=0][wvl canskip=false time=100][hffgchg2 chara=雁夜 face=怒2 pos=left time=300 twno=2][hfburstblood layer=0 ox=-120 oy=0][hfangry layer=0] D-Dammit, he always makes me look like a fool... Enough! Get him, Berserker!"::
45641::$$$message_0433_0000_0017$$$::"We'll combine our wits and pull out his beard...[wvl canskip=false time=200][playstop time=3000][hffgchg2 chara=雁夜 face=焦り pos=left time=300 twno=1][hfsweat layer=0 ox=-120 oy=0] Berserker?"::
45642::$$$message_0433_0000_0018$$$::"Damn... Damn you... Damn you... DAMN YOU!"::
45643::$$$message_0433_0000_0019$$$::"Oh? I was wondering who this gloomy man is. If it isn't the mad dog."::
45644::$$$message_0433_0000_0020$$$::"What is this dour suit for?[wvl][hfwww layer=1] You are a rabid dog with a collar, worse than a guard dog. You are no King of Knights. Why not go back to your bow-wow mode?"::
45645::$$$message_0433_0000_0021$$$::"WOOOOOORGH! I won't forgive you, King of Heroes![wvl][hfwww layer=0] I'll beat your insolent face in with my (lead pipe) sword!"::
45646::$$$message_0433_0000_0022$$$::"What?[wvl canskip=false time=100] Whoa, wait. What are you foaming at the mouth for? Aren't we on the same side? How about an aerial battle, or an underwater battle? It could be fun."::
45647::$$$message_0433_0000_0023$$$::"Oh, I know. We share a common fetish: stalking Saber. If we work together, perhaps we might unearth some new proclivities."::
45648::$$$message_0433_0000_0024$$$::"You're beyond help![wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=ランスロット face=笑顔2 pos=left time=300 textclear=0][hfsigh layer=0] I like peeping on my king. I can't help it. Anyone would do the same."::
45649::$$$message_0433_0000_0025$$$::"..."::
45650::$$$message_0433_0000_0026$$$::"But I will never tolerate what you said last time![wvl][hfwww layer=0] What do you mean, you'll 'pluck her flowers' yourself? How dare you speak in such an indecent way to my pure and innocent king!?"::
45651::$$$message_0433_0000_0027$$$::"What if you turn my king into a bad girl!? You must die here, venomous snake!"::
45652::$$$message_0433_0000_0028$$$::"Uh, wait. Just a second. You aren't here to humiliate Saber?"::
45653::$$$message_0433_0000_0029$$$::"Of course not! Who would dare lay a hand on the king!?[wvl][hfwww layer=0] The king belongs to everyone! She is meant to stand alone among the group, as we all watch over her warmly!"::
45654::$$$message_0433_0000_0030$$$::"Saber... I never actually thought I'd feel sorry for you..."::
45655::$$$message_0433_0000_0031$$$::"Um, okay? [wvl canskip=false time=300][stoptrans][hffgchg2 chara=雁夜 face=怒 pos=left twno=1 time=300][hfwww layer=0]Anyway, now's our chance, Berserker! Stand back, Sakura. This is going to be a real fight!"::
45656::$$$message_0433_0000_0032$$$::"Sakura!? You brought your bloodline's invaluable successor to the battlefield!?"::
45657::$$$message_0433_0000_0033$$$::"You don't have the right to criticize me, not after you abandoned Sakura![wvl][hfwww layer=0] And she's the strongest fighter we have!"::
45658::$$$message_0433_0000_0034$$$::"I see... I've changed my opinion, too. I'm taking Sakura back. I'll use my connections to send her to my distant relatives, the Edelfelts."::
45659::$$$message_0433_0000_0035$$$::"..."::
45660::$$$message_0433_0000_0036$$$::"Sakura...[wvl canskip=false time=300][hffgchg2 chara=雁夜 face=喜2 pos=left twno=1 time=300][hfsigh layer=0] Don't worry, I won't let that happen. I'm going to beat Tokiomi and give you your life back."::
45661::$$$message_0433_0000_0037$$$::"...You say you're doing this for Sakura. Then let me ask you one last question. Why are you seeking the Holy Grail Onsen? What wish will you save Sakura with?"::
45662::$$$message_0433_0000_0038$$$::"It's obvious[line len=2]I'll wish for Sakura's chest to be as big as Aoi's... No, she'll grow up to have an even better figure!"::
45663::$$$message_0433_0000_0039$$$::"...Mm!? You can do that!?"::
45664::$$$message_0433_0000_0040$$$::"......"]*�